<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%-include('../partials/head.ejs');%>
    <%-include('../partials/style.ejs');%>
    <title><%=title%></title>
</head>
<body>
    <%-include('../partials/nav.ejs');%>
    <div class="container mt-4 content">
        <h1>Healthy Fruits and Veggies API – Smart Food Choices for Better Health</h1>
        <div class="card mt-2">
            <div class="card-body">
                Welcome to Healthy Fruits and Veggies API, your go-to resource for making informed dietary decisions. Our API helps users determine whether a fruit or vegetable is safe for individuals with diabetes, blood pressure, or uric acid concerns.
            </div>
        </div>
        <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3">
            Why Choose Our API?
        </h4>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <ul class="list-group">
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ <b>Completely Free – </b> No hidden charges, forever free!</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ <b>No Authentication Required – </b> Use it instantly without an API key.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ <b>Health-Specific Filters – </b> Instantly check if a fruit or vegetable is sugar-friendly, BP-friendly, or uric acid-friendly.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ <b>Multi-Language Support – </b>Search using local and regional names for accurate results.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ <b>Simple & Fast Integration –</b> Easily integrate with health apps, diet planners, and food recommendation platforms.</li>
                  </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3">Who Can Benefit?</h4>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <ul class="list-group mb-3">
                    <li class="list-group-item">🥗 Developers building health-focused apps.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">💡 Nutritionists & Dietitians looking for quick food insights.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">📱 Health-Conscious Users making smarter dietary choices.</li>
                </ul>
                🚀 Start using the Healthy Fruits and Veggies API today—no sign-ups, no authentication, just instant access to health-friendly food recommendations!
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-4 bg-color bg-dark">
        <div class="container text-light text-center">
            <!-- <p class="display-5 mb-3">9iNe</p> -->
            <small class="text-white-50">&copy; Copyright by 9iNe. All rights reserved.</small>
        </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
            const currentPage = window.location.pathname;
            const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll(".navbar .nav-link");
      
            navLinks.forEach(link => {
                if (link.getAttribute("href") === currentPage) {
                    link.classList.add("active");
                } else {
                    link.classList.remove("active");
                }
            });
        });
      </script>
</body>
</html>